## 🚀 How to Use - 3 Options

### Option 1: Use Pre-Built Scripts (Easiest)
```bash
npm run test               # All tests, headless, serial
npm run test:headed        # Debug - see browser
npm run test:parallel      # Fast - 4 workers
npm run test:tags          # @smoke tests only
```

### Option 2: Custom Command Line
```bash
# Custom tag
CUCUMBER_TAGS="@regression" npm test

# Custom workers
CUCUMBER_WORKERS=2 npm test

# Combine everything
HEADED=true CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke" CUCUMBER_WORKERS=4 npm test
```

### Option 3: Modify npm Scripts
Edit `package.json` scripts section to customize defaults:
```json
"test:tags": "cross-env CUCUMBER_TAGS=\"@regression\" cucumber-js"
```

